  "instructions": [
    "Preheat broiler and adjust rack to 4-6 inches from the heat source.",
    "Cut cabbage into thin slices and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Brush olive oil over cabbage and season with salt and pepper.",
    "Broil cabbage for 2-3 minutes, or until slightly charred and wilted.",
    "In a large bowl, combine broiled cabbage, thinly sliced red onion, minced garlic, red pepper flakes, and freshly squeezed lime juice.",
    "Stir to combine and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Cover bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, garnish with chopped cilantro and serve chilled."
